  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d7d90acd337545242978d965e5b6e6f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heeeeey!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418689
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Who's yelling at me <i>this</i> early in the-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh... Haaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8612954484556955724
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I overslept again!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But I caught you this time!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Holy cow, Sayori, how long <i>has</i> it been since we've walked to school
      together?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8612954484556955729
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... I don't know...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889421
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Which means it's been too long!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889422
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm with ya, just yesterday I was thinking we should catch up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889423
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ehehe~ <SineText=4>Yeah</SineText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889424
    - rid: 1790118514879889425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well? Time's wasting, we should get going.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889426
